next: (a) verify X0 against the polymath15-2019 card; (b) decide: implement AFE (extend our
  quadrature to the barrier) vs run the Polymath15 C code (confirm t_0=2.2e4). The C-code path is
  the literal HANDOFF plan and cheaper; the AFE path is more work but gives us our own verified
  barrier evaluation.

